        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bonnie Franklin, Cheyenne Haynes\n- Television Shows: One Day at a Time, Survivor\n- Roles: actress, contestant\n- Companies: Tandem Productions\n\nFacts:\n- Bonnie Franklin starred as a divorced mother in the American sitcom One Day at a Time.\n- One Day at a Time was produced by Tandem Productions.\n- Norman Lear founded Tandem Productions and is the father of reality TV host Christopher \"Kit\" Hoover.\n- Cheyenne Haynes appeared in the reality game show Survivor.",
